[%# The recipes.yaml of the runner, dumped whole by the yaml formatter.

    A recipes.yaml can be of any depth, and a template cannot indent that
    correctly.  Provisioner::Recipe::formatters is the hook for this.

    The formatter turns every store: reference into secret:.  So this file
    names entries in the keepass database of the runner, and holds no
    passwords.  See SECRETS IN recipes in Provisioner::Recipe::trogrunner. -%]
[% recipes | yaml %]
